inute.","q":false,"c":1},{"lap":11,"text":"On the 11th lap Nuvolari went even faster, setting a new lap record of 2m00.8s (87.0 km/h).","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":13,"text":"On lap 13 Pintacuda passed Barbieri for 5th position.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":2},{"lap":15,"text":"Comotti pits with radiator problems; Soffietti moves up to third ahead of Pintacuda, Barbieri and Minozzi.","q":false,"c":4},{"lap":20,"text":"At 20 laps Nuvolari was leading Farina by 13 seconds with Soffietti the only other driver still on the same lap","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":30,"text":"Nuvolari's average is up to 85.3 km/h after 30 laps and Farina begins to lose ground. Minozzi retires with a broken axle.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":31,"text":"Pintacuda passes Soffietti for third, both a lap behind Farina; Comotti is charging back through the field.","q":false,"c":2},{"lap":40,"text":"Siena retires with plug problems, ending his duel with Barbieri.","q":false,"c":9},{"lap":50,"text":"By 50 laps Nuvolari held a 25s lead over Farina with Pintacuda third over 3 minutes behind","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":57,"text":"On the 57th lap Barbieri crashed against a tree. The Maserati was badly damaged but Barbieri suffered only a slight knee injury.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":8},{"lap":64,"text":"Dusio passes Cornaggia for sixth.","q":false,"c":5},{"lap":67,"text":"On the 67th lap Nuvolari made a new lap record with a time of 2m00.4s (87.3 km/h).","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":70,"text":"Nuvolari wins by 2 minutes from Farina; Pintacuda third, Soffietti fourth, Comotti fifth, then Dusio, Cornaggia-Medici and Romano.","q":false,"c":0}]}